      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sugamo_Prison",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "After WWII, occupation forces used Sugamo Prison to detain suspected war criminals awaiting the International Military Tribunal.",
